* PAY0001, $2,932.23 wire from the operating account, status \"sent\"\n- **Invoice status:** now marked paid\n\nThe wire request timed out. I didn't resend it. Instead I checked the payment list and found the wire had gone through as PAY0001, but the invoice still showed \"approved.\" I linked PAY0001 to INV-13400 to mark it paid. Only one payment exists.\n\nThe amount is under $10,000, so controller approval wasn't needed. The vendor's bank details are verified and it accepts wires. I left Cobalt Labs's other two invoices alone: INV-46859 was already paid, and INV-57474 is a draft that hasn't been approved yet.", "type": "text"}]}]}